---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from 'astrowind:config';

const metadata = {
  title: `Returns & Warranty — ${SITE.name}`,
  description: `Felizbay return policy for online retail orders (30 days, unused, original packaging) and the 2-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects.`,
};
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Returns & Warranty' }];
---

<Layout metadata={metadata} breadcrumbs={crumbs}>
  <section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 mx-auto lg:px-8 lg:py-20 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="font-bold font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tighter tracking-tighter">Returns &amp; Warranty</h1>
    <div
      class="mx-auto prose prose-lg max-w-4xl dark:prose-invert dark:prose-headings:text-slate-300 prose-md prose-headings:font-heading prose-headings:leading-tighter prose-headings:tracking-tighter prose-headings:font-bold prose-a:text-blue-600 dark:prose-a:text-blue-400 prose-img:rounded-md prose-img:shadow-lg mt-8"
    >
      <p><em>Last updated: October 28, 2026</em></p>
      <p>
        This page explains how returns, refunds, and warranty claims work for {SITE.name} purchases. It covers two channels:
        single-piece online retail orders placed through this website's checkout, and wholesale or project orders placed through
        written quotations.
      </p>

      <h2 id="returns">Returns — Online Retail Orders</h2>
      <p>
        If your online retail order (single-piece purchase through this website's checkout) is not the right fit, you
        can return it within <strong>30 days of delivery</strong>.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          The pool must be <strong>unused</strong> — not inflated, not filled with water — and returned in its original packaging
          with all included accessories (electric air pump, cover, repair kit, and storage bag).
        </li>
        <li>Refunds are issued to your original payment method after the returned item passes inspection.</li>
        <li>
          Return shipping is paid by the buyer, except for defective or incorrect items — in those cases we cover the
          return cost or provide a prepaid label.
        </li>
        <li>Custom or made-to-order items cannot be returned.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To start a return, email info@felizbay.com with your order reference and a short description of the reason. We
        reply within one business day with return instructions and the return address.
      </p>

      <h2 id="warranty">Warranty — 2-Year Limited</h2>
      <p>
        Felizbay pools and SPA tubs carry a <strong>2-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects</strong>,
        covering seams, valves, and drop-stitch fabric. Every pool ships with a repair kit for small field repairs, and
        spare parts — valves, patches, pumps, covers — remain available through info@felizbay.com for the life of the
        product. Model-specific warranty documentation is provided with each product; where that documentation differs
        from this section, it governs.
      </p>
      <p>The warranty does not cover:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>normal wear and abrasion from regular use;</li>
        <li>punctures or cuts from sharp objects, pets, or rough surfaces;</li>
        <li>damage from over-inflation above the recommended 4–5 PSI operating pressure;</li>
        <li>damage from improper water chemistry, cleaning agents, or UV exposure against the care instructions;</li>
        <li>unauthorized modifications or repairs;</li>
        <li>accidental damage, fire, or natural events.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The first remedy for a warranty issue is repair — patch, valve, or spare-part replacement — followed by
        replacement of the defective component or of the unit. To make a warranty claim, email info@felizbay.com with
        your order reference, a description of the issue, and photos. Claims are answered within one business day.
      </p>

      <h2 id="wholesale">Wholesale &amp; Project Orders</h2>
      <p>
        Wholesale, OEM, and project orders are placed through written quotations and order confirmations. Your quotation
        specifies prices, delivery terms, lead times, and any order-specific conditions, including any return
        arrangements. The 2-year limited warranty above applies to manufacturing defects on wholesale orders as well;
        transit and handling terms follow the agreed Incoterms (typically FOB Qingdao).
      </p>

      <h2 id="statutory-rights">Your Statutory Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing in this policy limits any mandatory consumer rights you have under the laws of your country or region.
      </p>

      <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For returns, warranty claims, or questions about this policy, contact us at info@felizbay.com — we reply within
        one business day.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
